     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\">\r\nHi\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Here is an example using Lavaan:<br>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zqLeboNwo1o&amp;list=PL6tc6IBlZmOX0GpHkTjYzzmDnTALk_sEp&amp;index=6&amp;t=447\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v%3DzqLeboNwo1o%26list%3DPL6tc6IBlZmOX0GpHkTjYzzmDnTALk_sEp%26index%3D6%26t%3D447&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792419439224000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3-QCb1mLEud-2cko_Fgb01\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zqLeboNwo1o&amp;list=PL6tc6IBlZmOX0GpHkTjYzzmDnTALk_sEp&amp;index=6&amp;t=447</a></div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Note that ULMC (unmeasured latent method contract) models are rarely identified and are not very useful. You might find the entire playlist useful, though it gets a bit technical at some points.</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>Mikko<br>\r\n<div><br>\r\n<blockquote type=\"cite\"></blockquote></div></div></div></div>"
