     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\"><div><div><div><blockquote type=\"cite\">\r\n<div>On 23. May 2021, at 6.35, Harmanjit Singh &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">harman...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:</div>\r\n<br>\r\n</blockquote></div></div></div></div>"
