    [
     3,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\"><div><div><div><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;float:none;display:inline!important\">I\r\n would appreciate it if someone can share the sample code to check common method bias using the method (I assume this is a common latent factor approach as showcased in the following video {from 6 - 10 mins}<span> </span></span><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CFBUECZgUuo\" style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v%3DCFBUECZgUuo&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792419439224000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2fhs3FGkFteKMlD8lUYwru\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=CFBUECZgUuo</a><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none;float:none;display:inline!important\">).</span><br style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\">\r\n<br style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\">\r\n<div class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Friday, August 30, 2019 at 4:29:21 PM UTC+5:30 Terrence Jorgensen wrote:<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left-width:1px;border-left-style:solid;border-left-color:rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">You didn&#39;t provide any other syntax (namely, your call to<span> </span><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">lavaan() </font><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">or any output)</font>, so I don&#39;t\r\n know how you are identifying your relative to how the Amos video assumed you would.  If you are using the default<span> </span><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><a href=\"https://eur03.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fstd.lv%2F&amp;data=04%7C01%7C%7Cce97060daa3645f4567c08d91d9bc3ce%7Ce9662d58caa44bc1b138c8b1acab5a11%7C1%7C0%7C637573377566437295%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000&amp;sdata=FcJlEBXdZb1rcrId8hQH7%2F%2Bydmg2JqUJ1mlcb7ZMjK8%3D&amp;reserved=0\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://eur03.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url%3Dhttp%253A%252F%252Fstd.lv%252F%26data%3D04%257C01%257C%257Cce97060daa3645f4567c08d91d9bc3ce%257Ce9662d58caa44bc1b138c8b1acab5a11%257C1%257C0%257C637573377566437295%257CUnknown%257CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%253D%257C3000%26sdata%3DFcJlEBXdZb1rcrId8hQH7%252F%252Bydmg2JqUJ1mlcb7ZMjK8%253D%26reserved%3D0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792419439224000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3c2NBobqFCyEWX0PVKWayn\">std.lv</a>=FALSE</font>,\r\n then the first loading will be fixed to 1 for identification, in which case you can change all your &quot;a&quot; labels to values 1 to equate them.  \r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>If you set<span> </span><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><a href=\"https://eur03.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fstd.lv%2F&amp;data=04%7C01%7C%7Cce97060daa3645f4567c08d91d9bc3ce%7Ce9662d58caa44bc1b138c8b1acab5a11%7C1%7C0%7C637573377566442286%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000&amp;sdata=JtZUvoscsmxHZ9SeHDbuUyH4YXOVFUtJu5SAirZfOC8%3D&amp;reserved=0\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://eur03.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url%3Dhttp%253A%252F%252Fstd.lv%252F%26data%3D04%257C01%257C%257Cce97060daa3645f4567c08d91d9bc3ce%257Ce9662d58caa44bc1b138c8b1acab5a11%257C1%257C0%257C637573377566442286%257CUnknown%257CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%253D%257C3000%26sdata%3DJtZUvoscsmxHZ9SeHDbuUyH4YXOVFUtJu5SAirZfOC8%253D%26reserved%3D0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792419439224000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2qZ0TGg_kC8lzhM_CN_uP6\">std.lv</a>=TRUE</font>,\r\n then your syntax should do what you are asking, but that doesn&#39;t mean the model is correct for your data.  The warning messages indicate that at least one of your latent variables (ETAs) may have negative variance.  Check your<font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><span> </span>summary()<span> </span></font>output.</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div>Terrence D. Jorgensen</div>\r\n<div>Assistant Professor, Methods and Statistics</div>\r\n<div>Research Institute for Child Development and Education, the University of Amsterdam</div>\r\n<div><a href=\"https://eur03.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.uva.nl%2Fprofile%2Ft.d.jorgensen&amp;data=04%7C01%7C%7Cce97060daa3645f4567c08d91d9bc3ce%7Ce9662d58caa44bc1b138c8b1acab5a11%7C1%7C0%7C637573377566447279%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C3000&amp;sdata=yylTOgqMJPPhIbniLUNtoHSv2OxcyjgMu5j0GiFAW98%3D&amp;reserved=0\" rel=\"nofollow\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://eur03.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url%3Dhttp%253A%252F%252Fwww.uva.nl%252Fprofile%252Ft.d.jorgensen%26data%3D04%257C01%257C%257Cce97060daa3645f4567c08d91d9bc3ce%257Ce9662d58caa44bc1b138c8b1acab5a11%257C1%257C0%257C637573377566447279%257CUnknown%257CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%253D%257C3000%26sdata%3DyylTOgqMJPPhIbniLUNtoHSv2OxcyjgMu5j0GiFAW98%253D%26reserved%3D0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792419439224000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3i8GWh2pYWGllleqrnlVqz\">http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen</a></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;text-decoration:none\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n</div></blockquote></div></div></div></div>"
